{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","entryId":"other-message-p7469","chapterId":"s896f6f06f9231bef","language":"zh-CN","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-message-p7469-45f2b57949295d887338","text":"[开拓者]，大事不妙。","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-918dcd5a1bb2c80aa050","text":"我就知道，事情不会顺利。","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-5d1bf88b472dbfea3b7a","text":"让我猜猜，又有什么「惊喜」发生了是吧？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-c659d4e3160abeaac127","text":"我和虚照老师被包围了","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-365aad10989664268d7b","text":"千星城的安保部队说我们扰乱治安，要拘捕我们","speaker":"三月七"}]}
